# Everything under template/ is pure template content — headers and
# instructions only, never real data — and is always safe to commit in
# full. No exclusions needed there.
#
# The live data directory (created by deploy.sh, outside this repo by
# default) is never inside this working copy, so there is nothing from
# real usage to gitignore here. If you ever choose to point the live path
# at a location inside this checkout instead of the recommended external
# path, add that path here before doing so.
